OL,3,GNEWSABurnham wants Neets report to be
OL,4,Awatershed moment, No 10 says, as Tories
OL,5,Acriticise welfare and tax proposals
OL,6,
OL,7,FPM Andy Burnham wants a review into UK
OL,8,Fyouth unemployment - published earlier
OL,9,F- to be a "watershed moment in how we
OL,10,Fthink about welfare and how we support
OL,11,Fyoung people", No 10 says
OL,13,FAlan Milburn's government-backed report
OL,14,Fproposes widespread changes to tax,
OL,15,Fwelfare and education to help get
OL,16,F440,000 young people into work by 2036
OL,18,FMilburn suggests - among other things -
OL,19,Fthat businesses should be taxed less
OL,20,Ffor employing young people, and the
OL,21,Fnumber of apprenticeships should double
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
